From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:09:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/17] tu/autotune: Add a probe that measures the costs on the
 GPU

TU_AUTOTUNE_CALIB=force measures the costs when the device is created instead of using the table, and
export=<path> writes them to a file. This is how new table entries are made.
---
